        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on current routines, constraints, and select pilot group for the program.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 87939,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, let's kick off the Integrated Wellbeing Program pilot. First step is to get a clear picture of the youths' current schedules to find the best slots for our activities. I've started a document for this, A1.",
            "mentions": [
              36599,
              87396,
              4543,
              483681
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 87939,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Could you please help populate A1 with the current routines? Especially school hours, therapy appointments, and any other fixed commitments. This is for T1. Once we see the gaps, we can discuss which youths would be a good fit for the initial pilot group.",
            "mentions": [
              36599
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 36599,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Okay, I can work on that. It's a bit different every day. I'll block out the main school times and the regular therapy slots for a few of the kids. Will take me a bit to get it all down.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 87396,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Thanks for starting this. While 36599 is on T1, we should define the criteria for the pilot group. Are we looking for a mix of ages and needs, or a more homogenous group to start? This will impact the vocational modules I'm planning.",
            "mentions": [
              36599
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 483681,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "what do you mean by homogenous?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 87939,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Good point, 87396. I think for the pilot, a smaller, more stable group might be best to test the structure. Maybe 4-5 youths who have shown some interest in activities before and have relatively predictable schedules?",
            "mentions": [
              87396
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 87939,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "It means youths with similar ages or support needs. It can make planning group activities easier sometimes.",
            "mentions": [
              483681
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thumbsup",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 4543,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "Maybe we can ask them who wants to join?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 36599,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "I've added the main schedules to A1. The afternoons after 4pm are mostly free, but dinner is at 6pm sharp. So that gives us a window. Mornings are all school or appointments.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 87396,
            "reply_to": "M9",
            "text": "Thanks, that's very helpful. The 4-6pm window on weekdays seems viable. Based on that and the goal of a stable group, I'd suggest considering Liam, Chloe, Sam, and maybe Maria. They are generally more open to new things and their schedules in A1 look manageable.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M11",
            "speaker_id": 87939,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "Yes, participation has to be voluntary. We can approach the youths we select first and explain the program to them.",
            "mentions": [
              4543
