            "speaker_id": 87939,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, I've drafted the key documents for supporting the youths and ourselves during the pilot. Please review:\n- A2: Individual Support and Development Plan Template (for T2)\n- A4: Shift Handover Checklist (for T7)\n- A7: Wellbeing and Engagement Monitoring Log (for T8)\nFeedback is welcome, let's try to keep them simple and practical.",
