            "speaker_id": 87939,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi everyone, we're two weeks into the pilot now. I've gathered feedback from staff and the youths and put together a summary note, A8, as part of T11. Please have a read and share your thoughts so we can make any needed adjustments.",
