          {
            "msg_id": "M60",
            "speaker_id": 36599,
            "reply_to": "M59",
            "text": "Thanks for putting this together. The summary A8 reflects what I've been seeing. The movie night is a massive success. The bake-off was great fun but a bit chaotic. Maybe we need a clearer structure for it next time. Also, Sam has really struggled to engage with the CV skills session. He seemed quite overwhelmed.",
