            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M61",
            "speaker_id": 87396,
            "reply_to": "M60",
            "text": "I noticed that with Sam too. The abstract nature of CVs was a challenge. The woodworking session, however, was a different story - he was focused and confident. Maybe we should reconsider if the current pilot group is the right fit for all modules. For the bake-off, I can create some simple recipe cards with steps to make it less chaotic and more of a guided learning experience.",
            "mentions": [
