          {
            "msg_id": "M63",
            "speaker_id": 87939,
            "reply_to": "M62",
            "text": "Thanks for raising that, 4543. Can you tell me a bit more about what happened? It's important we follow the steps in the crisis guide A3 in these situations. The monitoring log A7 should also be updated after an incident like that.",
            "mentions": [
