            "speaker_id": 87939,
            "reply_to": "M61",
            "text": "That brings up a key point about the pilot group. Perhaps Sam would benefit from swapping out of the CV module and we could bring in someone else, like David, who has been asking about getting a job? We don't have to have the same group for every single activity.",
